@orz/themes

The Pro themes (src/themes/pro-*.ts, with src/prohibitorum.ts) contain colour
values from Prohibitorum, https://github.com/TundraWork/Prohibitorum,
dashboard/src/styles/theme.css and schemes.css at commit 6d3bc42, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE-Apache-2.0 in this package).

They were modified: each value was resolved as a browser resolves it and
stored as opaque hex, mapped onto this package's tokens; the sidebar accent
was moved in lightness until it stands 1.2:1 off the sidebar; and the field
edge, chart, diff and terminal colours, which Prohibitorum does not define,
were derived from them.

Prohibitorum's NOTICE reads:

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Prohibitorum
Copyright 2026 Prohibitorum Authors (Jesse Cheng et al.)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Afterglow theme (src/themes/afterglow.ts) contains colour values from
Afterglow by yabatadesign: the terminal colours from Afterglow.itermcolors,
https://github.com/YabataDesign/afterglow-itermcolors at commit acdd71f, and
the code colours from Afterglow.tmTheme,
https://github.com/YabataDesign/afterglow-theme at commit 8af113f. Neither
repository states a licence; this package takes only the colour values and
credits their author here.

They were modified: the UI tokens, which Afterglow does not define, were
derived from them, with its red, green, orange and magenta lifted in
lightness to clear WCAG contrast on the page.
